SCOPE

This licence covers the parts of this repository written by its contributors:
SKILL.md, references/, scripts/, examples/ and this file.

It does NOT cover the prompts collected in motions/. Each prompt was written
and published by the person named in its MOTION.md and in CREDITS.md, on
https://prompt-motion.com, where it is offered to be copied and used. It is
reproduced here with attribution and a link to its source. Rights in each
prompt stay with its author.

Reference videos are not part of this repository at all. `scripts/harvest.mjs`
fetches them from the source gallery onto your own machine.

If you are an author listed in CREDITS.md and want your prompt removed, open an
issue and it will be taken out.
